This is still not a `policy statement' but just to say that we are =
listening
hard and we do not entirely disagree with any of the arguments (even =
when they
are contradictory:-).

The Team is of course aware of the useful facilities provided by e-TeX =
and is
also in close contact with the omega developers.

Robin's summary of the current situation is very good and we are aware =
that we
need to provide a reasonably detailed and definite answer to (almost) =
his
question:

  how should we best proceed from here?

and that the answer should be, if possible, one that takes account of =
the needs
of different devlopers whilst avoiding the dangers of trying to be all =
things
to all devlopers.


Frank and Chris

